863777_3417887216312392951_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zSNGdUKkUvwQ7kNvwEXShpz&_nc_oc=AdpwU-93W2HcIWj-ZH6Udwv-7HEzBhVz_S1VYpFosWcdruKAlqK7mHzGEMTknKBgXlg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTKKe4HfARtWLd85bmnHkpMd7r9fzl8Jl4Ujgx8qbxT0A&oe=6AE89A06"}, {"file_name": "Holopoint Quest 131 A.png", "id": "1773273320571879", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673625994_1773273323905212_5291317074947976367_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IMds5Pv04fMQ7kNvwFFnd4A&_nc_oc=AdolVy_2jN6MJ8vBUez8AIrjZf2jDyGOl45iaGks6TQ0SJULxvExXuWl8TpHJLA2R9U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTtl0PZTGqub5WYAdM_SGvvUroY7hySqqLcGM6pATtW5Q&oe=6AE8BC92"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer Cover.png", "id": "1735390780856030", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/618758916_1735390784189363_421930983540835202_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-ahMaO3auXQQ7kNvwGteeqv&_nc_oc=AdqlPbYyma5IIE0h6ySF7WJE5j1uA9BiWBaBkJSl7L6RMa79TbVGmb93LDbanBYN6Xg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMHgfknWVSxSRs16kAHTwmX5vvlrSVIUDaVnMNbG4R6Q&oe=6AE8A266"}, "display_name": "Holopoint", "keywords": ["Archery", "Wave", "Arrow", "Fitness", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Holopoint is pure archery madness. Fight your way through waves of responsive targets, samurai, and highly dangerous ninjas - all while drawing, nocking, and shooting your arrows as quickly as possible. \n\nHolopoint is a skill based game where progression is based on player skill and training rather than unlocks. Like many arcade style games, personal progress and a high score is the goal. This game quickly becomes difficult and requires an active mindset. Holopoint is designed so that only a few determined archers will reach the last wave.\n\nWARNING: THIS GAME GETS INTENSE. REMEMBER TO BREATH AND TAKE BREAKS.", "short_description"